Subject: [PATCH] yttrium: map D3D R5G6B5 and A1R5G5B5 to the matching Vulkan PACK16 formats

Gallium names packed formats from the least significant bit and Vulkan
names its PACK16 formats from the most significant one. The venus2 winsys
mapped PIPE_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM (D3DFMT_R5G6B5: blue in bits 0-4, red in
bits 11-15) to VK_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM_PACK16, which has blue in bits 11-15,
and PIPE_FORMAT_B5G5R5A1_UNORM (D3DFMT_A1R5G5B5) to
VK_FORMAT_B5G5R5A1_UNORM_PACK16, which also swaps red and blue and moves
alpha to bit 0. On RADV such textures and render targets came out with red
and blue swapped. NVIDIA's driver (610.57.04) does not support
VK_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM_PACK16 at all (vkGetPhysicalDeviceImageFormatProperties2
returns VK_ERROR_FORMAT_NOT_SUPPORTED), so R5G6B5 textures sampled black there.
They now map to VK_FORMAT_R5G6B5_UNORM_PACK16 and
VK_FORMAT_A1R5G5B5_UNORM_PACK16, core formats that both drivers support.

Evidence: docs/nvtex.md, docs/evidence/nvtex/ (src/d3d9_tex.cpp fmt=r5g6b5
and fmt=a1r5g5b5; host-tests/linearmips.c lists the formats each driver
supports).
Origin: vmlab-win3d nvtex worker.
---
diff --git a/src/gallium/winsys/yttrium/gdi/yttrium_venus2_format.c b/src/gallium/winsys/yttrium/gdi/yttrium_venus2_format.c
index 2878d78..c645eb0 100644
--- a/src/gallium/winsys/yttrium/gdi/yttrium_venus2_format.c
+++ b/src/gallium/winsys/yttrium/gdi/yttrium_venus2_format.c
@@ -93,10 +93,13 @@ yttrium_venus2_pipe_format(enum pipe_format format)
       return VK_FORMAT_R8G8B8_SNORM;
    case PIPE_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_SNORM:
       return VK_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_SNORM;
+   /* Gallium names packed formats from the least significant bit, Vulkan's
+    * PACK16 formats from the most significant one: B5G6R5 (D3D R5G6B5) is
+    * R5G6B5_UNORM_PACK16 and B5G5R5A1 (D3D A1R5G5B5) is A1R5G5B5. */
    case PIPE_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM:
-      return VK_FORMAT_B5G6R5_UNORM_PACK16;
+      return VK_FORMAT_R5G6B5_UNORM_PACK16;
    case PIPE_FORMAT_B5G5R5A1_UNORM:
-      return VK_FORMAT_B5G5R5A1_UNORM_PACK16;
+      return VK_FORMAT_A1R5G5B5_UNORM_PACK16;
    case PIPE_FORMAT_B4G4R4A4_UNORM:
       return VK_FORMAT_A4R4G4B4_UNORM_PACK16;
    case PIPE_FORMAT_R8_USCALED:
